WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:10.193
In tutorial 7.4, you'll act
on your recommendations,

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:12.268
starting with the steps worth the most.

00:00:13.309 --> 00:00:18.584
First, open Recommendations. The top
counts your open steps by priority,

00:00:18.634 --> 00:00:21.007
and Next step names the one to do first.

00:00:21.966 --> 00:00:25.941
Click High to see only the urgent
ones. You can also pick an area,

00:00:25.991 --> 00:00:29.144
or group the list by
worth, priority or area.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:34.145
Each step shows what it's
worth and the time it takes.

00:00:34.195 --> 00:00:36.864
Click Why it matters to
read the reason behind it.

00:00:39.491 --> 00:00:42.941
Then use the button beside it. It
takes you straight to the work,

00:00:42.991 --> 00:00:47.239
like improving a page, answering
a reply or reviewing pitches.

00:00:48.512 --> 00:00:51.837
To hand a step to your
developers, use Create ticket.

00:00:51.887 --> 00:00:56.377
It opens a ticket in Jira, Linear
or Asana, if you connected one.

00:00:57.362 --> 00:01:00.662
So you always know what to do
next, in order of what it's worth,

00:01:00.712 --> 00:01:02.596
with each step one click away.

00:01:03.866 --> 00:01:08.941
So, filter by priority or area, read why
it matters, start it with its button,

00:01:08.991 --> 00:01:10.546
or send it as a ticket.

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:13.995
You're ready to act on
your recommendations.

00:01:14.045 --> 00:01:18.012
Next, run a technical
audit in tutorial 7.5.
